ject, which has a GDV of RM480 million, is slated for completion in FY2026.\n\nIn Bangsar South, UOA is developing Duo Tower, which consists of two office blocks. The 34-storey Tower A will have 239 office units while the 38-storey Tower B will have more than 700,000 sq ft of lettable area. Duo Tower, which has a GDV of RM1.3 billion, was launched in FY2024 and is expected to be ready in FY2027.\n\nAlso launched in FY2024 was Bamboo Hills Residences, which sit on a 9.8-acre freehold plot. Its three 51-storey blocks have a total of 2,517 units. The development has a retail podium, a connecting bridge to Kentonmen MRT station and a wide array of facilities. Slated for completion in FY2028, it has a GDV of RM1.4 billion.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nUOADEV - Annual Report & CG Report - 2024 | KLSE Screener (https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/9575509)\nciteturn361search6 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.4 years ago; Crawled: last month; Annual Report for Financial Year Ended  | 31 Dec 2024 ... UOADEV - Annual Report 2024.pdf ... Company Name  | UOA DEVELOPMENT BHD\n\n# UOADEV\n\n# 1.650\n\n### +0.01 (+0.6%)\n\n### Annual Report & CG Report\n\nUOA DEVELOPMENT BHD\nAnnual Report for Financial Year Ended  | 31 Dec 2024\nSubject  | Annual Report & CG Report - 2024\n\nPlease refer attachment below.\n\n#### Attachments\n\nUOADEV - Annual Report 2024.pdf\n1.4 MB UOADEV - CG Report 31.12.2024.pdf\n996.6 kB\n\n#### Announcement Info\n\nCompany Name  | UOA DEVELOPMENT BHD\nStock Name  | UOADEV\nDate Announced  | 29 Apr 2025\nCategory  | Document Submission\nReference Number  | DCS-23042025-00028\n\n\nView original announcement--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGeneral Announcement::Release of Annual Report - UOA Development Bhd (https://links.sgx.com/1.0.0/corporate-announcements/N90Y0RVO8XHZUZI4/)\nciteturn361search7 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2.5 years ago; Cra